{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370050","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1037005001:1":{"text":"この辺りは危険だ。狂ったモンスターたちのせいで皆不安がっている。村を離れようと検討している村人もいるほどだ……","source_cn":"这附近最近不安全，发狂的怪物搅得人心惶惶，不少村民都在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA8F58E332B9221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037005002:1":{"text":"とは言っても、逃げ場などあるのだろうか……もう山中が汚染されていると聞く……","source_cn":"可是，又能搬去哪里呢……听说，这场污染几乎覆盖了整座山脉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2E168F047B624C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037005003:1":{"text":"こんな時は逃げるのではなく、団結して村を守るべきなのだ！","source_cn":"大家不该走，这时候更该团结起来，守护自己的村落！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765404D5ACCBF281","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守卫契尔忒":{"text":"守衛チェルット","source":"守卫契尔忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}